# PAM stack for the Kavis lock screen (item 70).
#
# The system's own rules and nothing else: common-auth is what login and
# every other service use, so an account that cannot log in cannot
# unlock either, and a fingerprint or smartcard module added to
# common-auth works here without this file changing.
#
# common-account is included as well: an expired or disabled account
# must not be able to unlock a screen it could not log into.
#
# No common-session and no common-password: unlocking starts no session
# and changes no password.
@include common-auth
@include common-account
